  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the air fryer to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Place the chilies, onion, and garlic in a bowl and mix well.",
    "Add the olive oil and mix until the vegetables are evenly coated.",
    "Place the mixture in the air fryer basket and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Remove the mixture from the air fryer and stir in the cilantro, heavy cream, lime juice, and salt.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a tagliere and top with grated cheddar cheese.",
    "Serve the rajas con crema hot and enjoy!"
